\tag{fdip}
\taxon{Discussion}
\title{From one background to finitely many}
\date{2026-11-17}

\p{The [transported cochain operator](fdip-00SR) varies with
the link assignment, while the [ring paired coefficient](fdip-00TJ)
is defined on the same matter module for every assignment.
The bosonic connection law in \ref{fdip-0077} used real positive
weights. What can be summed before such an order or a
normalizing inverse is available?}
